59
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,320
Let's go. I'll take you to sue him.

60
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,080
Okay, okay.

61
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,040
Let's get down to business.

62
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,720
Let's go.

63
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,440
Let's go.

64
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,200
Stay away from me.

65
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,800
You're such an embarrassment.

66
