132
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,159
That's why we get along.

133
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,320
I don't get along with them either.

134
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,240
Especially that Li Xiang,

135
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,040
