140
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,960
We get along.

141
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:07,760
How do I get along with you? My goodness.

142
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,640
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

143
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,840
Neither of us gets along with him.

144
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,600
