147
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,880
My goodness, just focus on driving.

148
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,520
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

149
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,720
There, there, there.

150
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,400
Mentor,

151
