159
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,760
A file folder.

160
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,640
Thank you, Mr. Li.

161
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,250
You're quite...

162
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,240
Throw up less. Don't let it leak.

163
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,200
I threw up all my breakfast.

164
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:58,580
If you can't handle it, I'll drive later.

165
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:03,460
What a coincidence. Where are you going?

166
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,840
