173
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,480
Get in the car.

174
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,680
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

175
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,730
Perfect timing.

176
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,320
Come on,

177
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,840
