203
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,040
Number 29. 29.

204
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,840
Brother Li, Brother Li. You're Brother Li, right?

205
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,520
What are you doing? Can't you see we're in line?

206
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,400
Everyone's in a hurry. Get in the back.

207
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:33,840
No.

208
