229
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:58,000
Hurry up, boss. It's going to time out.

230
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,960
Right away, right away, right away.

231
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,760
Brother Li, how about this?

232
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:00,880
After you finish these two orders,

233
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,280
