239
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:09,640
Brother Li, is the original price okay? I'm begging you.

240
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,040
It's not about the money.

241
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:12,730
I'm very busy right now.

242
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,400
Leave.

243
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,000
Don't crowd my shop.

244
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,880
Just go.

245
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,680
Don't crowd their shop.

246
