260
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,280
It absolutely won't affect you.

261
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:52,920
Mr. Li.

262
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,200
You must make sure your testimony

263
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,440
