839
00:39:40,160 --> 00:39:43,040
I think you're really naive.

840
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:48,130
Are you getting bold because you had some drinks?

841
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:49,520
Let me tell you,

842
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,280
in all my life,

843
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:54,680
I've never seen anyone do things like you.

844
00:39:55,080 --> 00:39:57,680
You really don't care about the consequences.

845
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,760
Let me interview you.

846
00:40:00,560 --> 00:40:02,200
What were you thinking?

847
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:04,460
You wanted to start a law firm on your own?

848
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:15,480
Then let me say a few words.

849
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:19,360
As for me,

850
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:23,480
I just want to do what I want,

851
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:26,480
without being tied down

852
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:28,680
by anyone or anything.

853
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,480
Right?

854
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:32,480
It's definitely hard.

855
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:33,880
But who doesn't have it hard?

856
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,280
Just overcome it.

857
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:37,480
As for me,

858
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:39,920
when I first saw you setting up the stall,

859
00:40:39,920 --> 00:40:41,050
I thought to myself,

860
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:44,160
it wouldn't last three months. It would definitely fail.

861
00:40:44,160 --> 00:40:45,640
But now,

862
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:47,480
I really admire you.

863
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:48,560
Do you know why?

864
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:49,080
Why?

865
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:50,410
Give me the microphone.

866
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:54,220
Because there's a saying.

867
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:56,520
I don't know if you've heard it.

868
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:57,400
Tell me.

869
00:40:58,400 --> 00:41:00,800
God helps those who help themselves.

870
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:03,880
Passion overcomes all difficulties.

871
00:41:05,400 --> 00:41:08,320
As long as these difficulties don't kill me,

872
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:10,320
I'll fight to the death.

873
00:41:10,600 --> 00:41:12,130
I will definitely succeed.

874
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:17,920
When I was at my lowest,

875
00:41:18,520 --> 00:41:20,360
you lent me a helping hand

876
00:41:20,720 --> 00:41:22,040
and brought me cases.

877
00:41:22,200 --> 00:41:23,280
I really have to thank you.

878
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:26,200
No, you're being too polite, Along.

879
00:41:26,520 --> 00:41:27,880
As for me, I just wanted to

880
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:29,280
make some money

881
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:31,480
and buy a bigger house for my mom.

882
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:32,880
You're so filial.

883
00:41:33,880 --> 00:41:35,360
My dad passed away early.

884
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:38,840
Besides leaving me with a genetic disease

885
00:41:39,040 --> 00:41:40,160
and that bathhouse,

886
00:41:40,160 --> 00:41:41,360
he left nothing else.

887
00:41:41,520 --> 00:41:42,800
Then my mom

888
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:45,800
raised me all by herself.

889
00:41:47,240 --> 00:41:48,400
In my memory,

890
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:50,600
she never rested for a single day.

891
00:41:51,480 --> 00:41:54,440
I just figured I'd let her rest early

892
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:56,000
and enjoy life.

893
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,520
I couldn't tell.

894
00:41:58,520 --> 00:42:00,080
You're quite thoughtful.

895
00:42:00,080 --> 00:42:02,520
Anyway, let's not talk about this.

896
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:04,040
I just figured,

897
00:42:05,040 --> 00:42:07,320
I don't have your

898
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:09,040
passion or ideals.

899
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:12,120
But when it comes to getting business,

900
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:14,480
in this area,

901
00:42:16,120 --> 00:42:17,880
I'm the best. No problem.

902
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:20,640
Okay, that's all I need to hear.

903
00:42:20,640 --> 00:42:23,080
We'll keep going.
